	(text_box "This is a device that is designed to connect to a digital piano with aux out and a usb-midi. It will allow user to connect piano and output bluetooth audio and midi. This device may also include a screen and controls. The planed primary components are the stm32F446, pcm1808 and cc2456."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
